  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"937\">\n<p data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"937\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"870\">Air culture</strong> detects <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"917\">bacterial and fungal contamination</strong> in the environment.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1056\">\n<p data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1056\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Used for <strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"970\">infection control</strong> in sensitive areas like <strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1055\">ICU, operation theaters, labs, and pharmaceutical setups</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1157\">\n<p data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1157\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Helps evaluate <strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1089\">air quality</strong>, HVAC efficiency, and effectiveness of <strong data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1156\">disinfection procedures</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1264\">\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1264\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1178\">High CFU count</strong> indicates <strong data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1209\">poor air quality</strong>, risk of nosocomial infection, or improper sanitation.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
